replication_title:
Are Transporter Genes Other than the Chloroquine Resistance Locus (
                    <i>pfcrt</i>
                    ) and Multidrug Resistance Gene (
                    <i>pfmdr</i>
                    ) Associated with Antimalarial Drug Resistance?

No association between microsomal triglyceride transfer protein (
            <i>MTP</i>
            ) haplotype and longevity in humans
